  "name": "Loop",
  "description": "Open-source automated insulin delivery (AID) app for iOS, built on the LoopKit frameworks. It reads continuous glucose monitor data and commands an insulin pump to form a closed-loop 'artificial pancreas' for people with type 1 diabetes. A flagship open-source medical-device software project in the #WeAreNotWaiting community.",
